--!nocheck
--[[
    99_red_balloons.luau
    Survive the Killer - Direwick Festival, "99 Red Balloons" quest.

    Quest: "Pop a total of 99 red balloons across all maps."  (cumulative, server-side)

    How the game actually does it:
      - Red quest balloons are tagged "BalloonRed" by the server when a map loads.
      - DirewickFestivalVFXHandler only draws the pop (particle + sound + colour).
        It sets a LOCAL "Popped" attribute and, for plain "Balloon" decor, resets it
        after 7 seconds. None of that is what the quest counts.
      - The server has its own Touched listener, so a pop only registers when the
        character genuinely overlaps the balloon. Moving the root part into it is
        the only reliable way to make that happen from the client.

    Written to run on Delta Executor:
      - no Drawing API (unreliable on Delta, especially mobile)
      - no hookfunction / debug.setupvalue / gethiddenproperty
      - gethui() -> CoreGui -> PlayerGui fallback chain
      - getgenv() guard so re-executing replaces the previous run instead of stacking
--]]

local Players           = game:GetService("Players")
local CollectionService = game:GetService("CollectionService")
